	Copy `count' forth screens from an extent of screens starting at block
	number `in' to the extent starting at block number `out'.  If in > out
	the copy occurs from first block to last block.  If in < out the copy
	occurs from last block to first block.  Thus the copy takes place
	correctly even if the input and output extents overlap.  BEWARE, THIS
	IS A VERY DANGEROUS WORD.

